		{
			dependencies: ["38D6971551A08950"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FFAFAF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>首领杀手</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>8</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 攻击伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+300 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 对首领和玩家的伤害提升。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+300 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 对他们造成击退效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会无视第四诅咒，并始终造成全额伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次击中都会恢复 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>10</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生命之力。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>邪恶精华、扭曲之心、认可、下界合金和红石。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 右键能力只对被诅咒者生效。其他人只是在挥舞一把昂贵的剑。"
			]
