				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>15</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 攻击伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+200 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 对首领和玩家的伤害提升。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+200 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>击退和</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+10 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生命偷取。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>始终造成全额伤害，并继承大多数剑的附魔效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次攻击都会为目标施加可怕的负面效果。</grad></shadow>"
