				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用它杀死的东西的肉都能被烹饪。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>兼具盾牌功能，格挡时可吸收投射物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用此武器击杀的新物种会永久提升你的伤害和护甲，最多可叠加 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 次。每次提升 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+0.5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>持有它可构建 </grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>血怒成长</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，为被诅咒者提供力量与生命偷取，但会消耗你的生命值。它无法杀死你。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>此整合包重写了配方，涉及 The Infinitum、煎锅、深渊精华和暴力诅咒。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
