		{
			dependencies: [
				"2B49E79ABB521180"
				"24D9E56712D86874"
			]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E03131 to=#FFAFAF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>万物皆有回报</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在以下所有条件都满足的情况下，击杀一个 </grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>Warden</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你佩戴着七诅咒之戒。</grad></shadow>"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你正背负着荒芜的重担。</grad></shadow>"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你值得拥有，在本整合包中，这意味着在竞技场中度过世界时间的 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>80 %</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你已获得全部 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>颗深渊之心。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>奖章会漂浮在守卫死亡的位置，归你所有。其他人无法拾取它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FFAFAF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>功能说明</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>对你造成的所有伤害都变为治疗。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你收到的所有治疗都会转化为伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你收到的所有正面效果都会变成可叠加的虚弱效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你受到的所有负面效果都会转化为叠加的“力量”。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 神秘卷轴栏位。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 装备前请先阅读这四行。你的整个建造都必须围绕它们进行重写，而这正是重点所在。"
				""
				"[!info] 每个玩家一生只会掉落一次。"
			]
