				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>圣石留下的东西。七种诅咒都已消失，丰厚的回报也留了下来。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>25 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 受到的所有来源伤害减少。</grad></shadow>"
